+- What was implemented: Added the database migration authoring guide and pinned it as a release-gated documentation artifact. The guide covers paired migration file naming, `schema_migrations`, redacted local Postgres environment setup, exact migration verification commands, expected outputs, failure recovery for unhealthy Postgres, dirty migration states, downgrade failures, backup/forward-fix recovery, stable JSON envelope expectations, isolated Postgres integration tests, and redaction.
